OL,3,GNEWSACall for 'greater openness to
OL,4,Achange' at Cambridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vice-chancellor of Cambridge has
OL,7,Fcalled for a "greater openness to
OL,8,Fchange" at the university.
OL,10,FIn a speech to university staff, Prof
OL,11,FDeborah Prentice said it had been a
OL,12,F"very challenging time" following the
OL,13,Fdeath of former professor Jason Arday.
OL,15,FThe 41-year-old was found dead at his
OL,16,Fhome in London on 14 August, a week
OL,17,Fafter resigning from his position as
OL,18,Fprofessor of sociology of education
OL,19,Ffollowing intense scrutiny over
OL,20,Fallegations of plagiarism. He had
OL,21,Fdenied the claims.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
