OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall for 'greater openness to
OL,4,Achange' at Cambridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrentice said: "The strongest signal
OL,7,Fthat an organisation needs to change is
OL,8,Fwhen things go wrong, and therefore we
OL,9,Fmust take the losses, the setbacks, and
OL,10,Fheaven knows the tragedies very, very
OL,11,Fseriously."
